WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Start with a kernl. Compose runtime, permissions, services, and your shell.

00:06.000 --> 00:11.000
Connect your host with createShellBridge(adapter).

00:11.000 --> 00:16.000
Register a theme service. App requests pass through capability checks.

00:16.000 --> 00:20.000
Build bench from kernl: runtime routing, then a shell around the sandbox.

00:20.000 --> 00:24.000
Add ACL permissions and identity from the services package.

00:24.000 --> 00:28.000
Connect host services and window management. The bench interface assembles.

00:28.000 --> 00:32.000
bench: a developer runtime built with kernl. The app receives its host theme.

00:32.000 --> 00:38.000
Build with kernl. GitHub: kernlize/web. npm: kernlize. JSR: @kernl.
